# the record of the crown, one numbered step to a line, in step order.
# <n> seat <house> <berth>              a house takes a berth
# <n> board <berth> <berth> <h> <h>     two berths meet, with the hands each took
# <n> bye                               no argument at all
# <n> concede <berth> <berth>           the first berth named gives the board up
# <n> strike <house>                    a house comes off the roll
# <n> close                             the round ends and the bracket is reseated
  1 seat arden south-2
  2 seat fenwick east-1
  3 seat lowen west-1
  4 seat durrow north-3
  5 seat ingle east-3
  6 seat hurst south-1
  7 seat corvane west-2
  8 seat gorrel north-1
  9 seat birling east-2
 10 board south-2 east-2 7 8
